            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "please review https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#ai-assisted-work\r\n\r\nthere is way too much extraneous info in the PR description:\r\n\r\n\r\n> **Test:** new regression test in `ex_cmds/cd_spec.lua` (\"nvim_open_win / nvim_win_set_buf keep the caller's cwd\") — float open + `nvim_win_set_buf` keep the caller's `:bcd` dir; verified it fails on the pre-fix code.\r\n\r\nthis is obvious from the diff\r\n\r\n \r\n> **Verification:** float repro, `nvim_win_set_buf`/ui2 repro, live TUI, `make functionaltest` for api/ui/options/ex_cmds/autocmd/plugin — all green.\r\n\r\ni really don't need to know this.\r\n\r\nthose are just examples, not an exhaustive list. ",
